001	GEN	001	019	And the euentid and the morwetid was maad, the fourthe dai.
001	GEN	001	020	Also God seide, The watris brynge forth a `crepynge beeste of lyuynge soule, and a brid fleynge aboue erthe vndur the firmament of heuene.
