002	EXO	021	029	That if the oxe was `a pultere with horn fro yisterdai and the thridde dai ago, and men warneden `the lord of hym, nether the lord closide hym, and he sleeth a man, ethir womman, bothe the oxe schal be oppressid with stoonus, and thei schulen sle `the lord of hym;
002	EXO	021	030	that if prijs is put to the lord, he schal yyue for his lijf what euer he is axide.
