002	EXO	022	018	Thou schalt not suffre witchis to lyue.
002	EXO	022	019	He that doith letcherie with a beeste, die by deeth.
002	EXO	022	020	He that offrith to goddis, out takun to the Lord aloone, be he slayn.
002	EXO	022	021	Thou schalt not make sory a comelyng, nether thou schalt turmente hym; for also ye weren comelyngis in the lond of Egipt.
002	EXO	022	022	Ye schulen not anoye a widewe, and a fadirles ethir modirles child.
