002	EXO	023	006	Thou schalt not bowe in the doom of a pore man.
002	EXO	023	007	Thou schalt fle a lesyng. Thou schalt not sle an innocent man, and iust; for Y am aduersarie to a wickid man.
002	EXO	023	008	Take thou not yiftis, that blynden also prudent men, and destryen the wordys of iust men.
002	EXO	023	009	Thou schalt not be diseseful to a pilgrym, for ye knowen the soulis of comelyngis, for also ye weren pilgryms in the lond of Egipt.
