002	EXO	037	014	bi alle the feet of the boord ayens the coroun, and he puttide barris in to the serclis, that the `boord may be borun.
002	EXO	037	015	And he made tho barris of the trees of Sechym, and cumpasside tho with gold.
002	EXO	037	016	And he made vesselis to dyuerse vsis of the boord, vessels of vynegre, violis, and litle cuppis, and censeris of pure gold, in whiche the fletynge sacrifices schulen be offrid.
002	EXO	037	017	And he made a candilstike, betun out with hamer, of clenneste gold, of whos barre yerdis, cuppis, and litle rundelis and lilies camen forth;
002	EXO	037	018	sixe in euer eithir side, thre yerdis on o side, and thre on the tother side; thre cuppis in the maner of a note bi ech yerde, and litle rundels to gidere, and lilies;
002	EXO	037	019	and thre cuppis at the licnesse of a note in the tother yerde, and litle rundels to gidere, and lilies; forsothe the werk of sixe schaftis, that camen forth of the `stok of the candilstike, was euene.
002	EXO	037	020	Sotheli in that barre weren foure cuppis, in the maner of a note, and litle rundels and lilies weren bi alle cuppis;
002	EXO	037	021	and litle rundels vndur twei schaftis, bi thre placis, whiche to gidre be maad sixe schaftis comynge forth of o barre;
002	EXO	037	022	therfor and the litle rundels, and schaftis therof, weren alle betun out with hamer, of pureste gold.
002	EXO	037	023	He made also seuene lanternes, with her `snytyng tongis, and the vessels where `tho thingis, that ben snytid out, ben quenchid, of clennest gold.
002	EXO	037	024	The candilstike with alle his vessels weiyede a talent of gold.
002	EXO	037	025	He made also the auter of encense, of trees of Sechym, hauynge a cubit bi square, and twei cubitis in heiythe, of whos corneris camen forth hornes.
002	EXO	037	026	And he clothide it with clenneste gold, and the gridele, and wallis, and hornes;
002	EXO	037	027	and he made to it a litil goldun coroun bi cumpas, and twei goldun ryngis vndur the coroun, bi ech syde, that barris be put in to tho, and the auter mow be borun.
002	EXO	037	028	Forsothe he made tho barris of the trees of Sechym, and hilide with goldun platis.
002	EXO	037	029	He made also oile to the oynement of halewyng, and encense of swete smellynge spiceries, moost clene, bi the werk of `a makere of oynement.
002	EXO	038	001	He made also the auter of brent sacrifice of the trees of Sechym, of fyue cubitis bi square, and of thre cubitis in heiythe;
002	EXO	038	002	whose hornes camen forth of the corneris, and he hilide it with platis of bras.
002	EXO	038	003	And in to vsis therof he made redi of bras dyuerse vessels, caudruns, tongis, fleischhokis, hokis, and `resseittis of firis.
002	EXO	038	004	He made also the brasun gridile therof, `bi the maner of a net, and a `panne for colis vndur it, in the myddis of the auter.
