002	EXO	038	006	and he made tho same barris of the trees of Sechym, and hilide with platis of bras.
002	EXO	038	007	And ledde in to the serclis that stonden forth in the sidis of the auter. Forsothe thilke auter was not sad, but holowe of the bildyngis of tablis, and voide with ynne.
002	EXO	038	008	He made also a `greet waischyng vessel of bras, with his foundement, of the myrours of wymmen that wakiden in the `greet street of the tabernacle.
