009	1SA	008	009	Now therfor here thou her vois; netheles witnesse thou to hem; biforseie thou to hem the riyt of the kyng, that schal regne on hem.
009	1SA	008	010	Therfor Samuel seide alle the wordis of the Lord to the puple, that hadde axid of him a king; and he seide,
