009	1SA	008	012	and he schal make hem `to hym silf rideris, and biforegoeris of hise cartis; and he schal ordeyne to hym tribunes, `that is, souereyns of a thousynd, and centuriouns, `that is, souereyns of an hundrid, and eereris of hise feeldis, and reperis of cornes, and smythis of hise armeris, and charis.
009	1SA	008	013	Also he schal make youre douytris makeris of `oynementis to hym silf, and fueris, and bakeris.
