010	2SA	023	005	And myn hows is not so greet anentis God, that he schulde make with me euerlastynge couenaunt, stidefast and maad strong in alle thingis; for al myn helthe hangith of him, and al the wille `that is, al my desir, goith in to hym, and no thing is therof, that makith not fruyt.
010	2SA	023	006	Forsothe alle trespassouris schulen be drawun out as thornes, that ben not takun with hondis.
