011	1KI	020	007	Forsothe the kyng of Israel clepide alle the eldere men of the lond, and seide, Perseyue ye, and se, that he settith tresoun to vs; for he sente to me for my wyues, and sones, and for siluer, and gold, and Y forsook not.
011	1KI	020	008	And alle the gretter men in birthe, and al the puple seiden to hym, Here thou not, nether assente thou to hym.
