012	2KI	025	019	and thre porteris, and oon onest seruaunt of the citee, that was a souereyn ouer men werriours, and fyue men `of hem that stoden bifor the king, whiche he foond in the citee; and he took Sopher, the prince of the oost, that preuide yonge knyytis, `ether men able to batel, of the puple of the lond, and sixe men of the comyns, that weren foundyn in the citee;
012	2KI	025	020	whiche Nabuzardan, prince of the chyualrie, took, and ledde to the king of Babiloyne, in to Reblatha.
012	2KI	025	021	And the kyng of Babiloyne smoot hem, and killide hem in Reblatha, in the lond of Emath; and Juda was translatid fro his lond.
012	2KI	025	022	Sotheli he made souereyn Godolie, sone of Aicham, sone of Saphan, to the puple that was left in the lond of Juda; which puple Nabugodonosor, king of Babiloyne, hadde left.
012	2KI	025	023	And whanne alle the duykis of knyytis hadde herd these thingis, thei, and the men that weren with hem, that is, that the king of Babiloyne hadde ordeyned Godolie, thei camen `to Godolie, in Maspha, Ismael, sone of Nathanye, and Johannan, sone of Charee, and Saraie, sone of Thenameth of Nechophat, and Jeconye, sone of Machati, thei, and Machat, and the felowis of hem.
012	2KI	025	024	And Godolie swoor to hem, and to the felowis of hem, and seide, Nyle ye drede to serue the Caldeis; dwelle ye in the lond, and serue ye the king of Babiloyne, and it schal be wel to you.
012	2KI	025	025	Forsothe it was don in the seuenthe monethe, `that is, sithen Godolie was maad souereyn, Hismael, the sone of Nathanye, sone of Elysama, of the `kyngis seed, cam, and ten men with hym, and thei smytiden Godolie, which diede; but also thei smytiden Jewis and Caldeis, that weren with hym in Maspha.
012	2KI	025	026	And al the puple roos fro litil `til to greet, and the prynces of knyytis, and camen in to Egipt, and dredden Caldeis.
012	2KI	025	027	Therfor it was doon in the seuenthe and threttithe yeer of transmigracioun, `ether passyng ouer, of Joakyn, kyng of Juda, in the tweluethe monethe, in the seuene and twentithe dai of the monethe, Euylmeradach, kyng of Babiloyne, in the yeer in which he bigan to regne, reiside the heed of Joakyn, kyng of Juda,
012	2KI	025	028	fro prisoun, and spak to hym benygneli; and he settide the trone of Joakyn aboue the trone of kyngis, that weren with hym in Babilonye.
012	2KI	025	029	And he chaungide `hise clothis, whiche he hadde in prisoun; and he eet breed euer in the siyt of Euylmeradach, in alle the daies of his lijf.
012	2KI	025	030	Also Euylmeradach ordeynede sustenaunce `to hym with out ceessyng; which sustenaunce also was youun of the kyng to hym bi alle daies, and in alle the daies of his lijf.
#
# BOOK	013	1CH	1 Chronicles	1 Chronicles
013	1CH	001	001	Adam gendride Seth; Enos,
013	1CH	001	002	Chaynan, Malaleel, Jared,
013	1CH	001	003	Enoch, Matussale, Lameth;
013	1CH	001	004	Noe gendride Sem, Cham, and Japhet.
013	1CH	001	005	The sones of Japhat weren Gomer, Magog, Magdai, and Jauan, Tubal, Mosoch, and Tiras.
013	1CH	001	006	Forsothe the sones of Gomer weren Asceneth, and Riphat, and Thogorma.
013	1CH	001	007	Sotheli the sones of Jauan weren Helisa, and Tharsis, Cethym, and Dodanym.
013	1CH	001	008	The sones of Cham weren Chus, and Mesraym, Phuth, and Chanaan.
013	1CH	001	009	Sotheli the sones of Chus weren Saba, and Euila, Sabatha, and Regma, and Sabathaca. Forsothe the sones of Regma weren Saba, and Dadan.
013	1CH	001	010	Sotheli Chus gendride Nemroth; this Nemroth bigan to be myyti in erthe.
013	1CH	001	011	Forsothe Mesraym gendride Ludym, and Ananyn, and Labaym,
013	1CH	001	012	and Neptoym, and Phetrusym, and Casluym, of whiche the Philisteis and Capthureis yeden out.
013	1CH	001	013	Sotheli Chanaan gendride Sidon his first gendrid sone,
013	1CH	001	014	and Ethei, and Jebusei, and Ammorrei, and Gergesei,
013	1CH	001	015	and Euei, and Arachei, and Synei,
013	1CH	001	016	and Aradye, and Samathei, and Emathei.
013	1CH	001	017	The sones of Sem weren Elam, and Assur, and Arphaxat, and Luth, and Aram. Forsothe the sones of Aram weren Hus, and Hul, and Gothor, and Mosoch.
013	1CH	001	018	Forsothe Arphaxat gendride Sale; which hym silf gendride Heber.
013	1CH	001	019	Sotheli to Heber weren borun twei sones; name of oon was Phaleg, for the lond was departid in hise daies; and the name of his brother was Jectan.
013	1CH	001	020	Forsothe Jectan gendride Elmodad, and Salech, and Aselmod,
013	1CH	001	021	and Jare, and Adoram, and Vzal,
013	1CH	001	022	and Deda, Hebal, and Ameth, and Abymael,
013	1CH	001	023	and Saba, also and Ophir, and Euila, and Jobab; alle these weren the sones of Jectan.
013	1CH	001	024	Sem, Arphaxat, Sale,
013	1CH	001	025	Heber, Phalech, Ragau,
013	1CH	001	026	Seruth, Nachor, Thare, Abram;
013	1CH	001	027	forsothe this is Abraham.
013	1CH	001	028	The sones of Abraham weren Isaac and Ismael.
013	1CH	001	029	And these the generaciouns of hem; the firste gendrid of Ismael Nabioth, and Cedar, and Abdahel, and Mapsam,
013	1CH	001	030	and Masma, and Duma, and Massa, Adad, and Themar, Jahur, Naphis, Cedma;
013	1CH	001	031	these ben the sones of Ismael.
013	1CH	001	032	Forsothe the sones of Cethure, secoundarie wijf of Abraham, whiche sche gendride, weren Zamram, Jersan, Madan, Madian, Jelboe, Sue. Sotheli the sones of Jersan weren Saba, and Dadan. Forsothe the sones of Dadan weren Assurym, and Latusym, and Laomym.
013	1CH	001	033	Sotheli the sones of Madian weren Epha, Ethei, and Enoch, and Abdia, and Heldaa. Alle these weren the sones of Cethure.
013	1CH	001	034	Forsothe Abraham gendride Isaac; whose sones weren Esau and Israel.
013	1CH	001	035	The sones of Esau weren Eliphat, Rahuel, Semyaus, and Elam, and Chore.
013	1CH	001	036	The sones of Eliphath weren Theman, Omer, Sephi, Gethem, Genez, Cenez, Thanna, Amalech.
013	1CH	001	037	The sones of Rahuel weren Naab, Gazara, Samma, Masa.
013	1CH	001	038	The sones of Seir weren Lothan, Sobal, Sebeon, Ana, Dison, Eser, Disan.
013	1CH	001	039	The sones of Lothan weren Horry, Huma; sotheli the sistir of Lothan was Thanna.
013	1CH	001	040	The sones of Sobal weren Alian, and Manaath, and Ebal, and Sephi, and Onam. The sones of Sebeon weren Ana, and Anna. The sone of Ana was Dison.
013	1CH	001	041	The sones of Dison weren Amaram, and Hesabam, and Lecram, and Caram.
013	1CH	001	042	The sones of Eser weren Balaam, and Jaban, and Jesan. The sones of Disan weren Hus and Aram.
013	1CH	001	043	These ben the kyngis that regneden in the lond of Edom, bifor that a kyng was on the sones of Israel. Bale, the sone of Beor; and the name of his citee was Danaba.
013	1CH	001	044	Sotheli Bale was deed; and Jobab, sone of Zare of Basra, regnyde for hym.
013	1CH	001	045	And whanne Jobab was deed, Husam of the lond of Themayns regnede for hym.
013	1CH	001	046	And Husam diede; and Adad, sone of Badad, that smoot Madian in the lond of Moab, regnyde for hym; and the name of the citee of `hym, that is, of Adad, was Abyud.
013	1CH	001	047	And whanne Adad was deed, Semela of Maserecha, regnede for hym.
013	1CH	001	048	But also Semela was deed, and Saul of Robooth, which is set bisidis the ryuer, regnyde for hym.
013	1CH	001	049	Also whanne Saul was deed, Balanam, the sone of Achabor, regnyde for him.
013	1CH	001	050	But also he was deed, and Adad, the name of whos citee was Phou, regnede for hym; and his wijf was clepid Methesael, the douyter of Mathred, douyter of Mezaab.
013	1CH	001	051	Forsothe whanne Adad was deed, dukis bigunnen to be in Edom for kyngis; duyk Thanna, duyk Alia, duyk Jetheth,
013	1CH	001	052	duyk Olibama, duyk Ela, duyk Phynon,
013	1CH	001	053	duik Ceneth, duyk Theman, duyk Mabsar,
013	1CH	001	054	duyk Magdiel, duyk Iram. These weren the duykis of Edom.
013	1CH	002	001	Forsothe the sones of Israel weren Ruben, Symeon, Leuy, Juda, Isachar, and Zabulon,
013	1CH	002	002	Dan, Joseph, Beniamyn, Neptalym, Gad, Aser.
013	1CH	002	003	The sones of Juda weren Her, Onam, Sela; these thre weren borun to hym of Sue, a douyter of Canaan. Sotheli Her, the first gendrid sone of Juda, was yuel bifor the Lord, and he killide hym.
013	1CH	002	004	Forsothe Thamar, wijf of the sone of Judas, childide to hym Phares, and Zaram; therfor alle the sones of Judas weren fyue.
013	1CH	002	005	Sotheli the sones of Phares weren Esrom, and Chamul.
013	1CH	002	006	And the sones of Zare weren Zamry, and Ethen, and Eman, and Calchab, and Dardan; fyue togidere.
013	1CH	002	007	The sone of Charmy was Achar, that disturblide Israel, and synnede in the theft of thing halewid to the Lord.
013	1CH	002	008	The sone of Ethan was Azarie.
013	1CH	002	009	Sotheli the sones of Esrom, that weren borun to hym, weren Jeramael, and Aram, and Calubi.
013	1CH	002	010	Forsothe Aram gendryde Amynadab. Sotheli Amynadab gendride Naason, the prince of the sones of Juda.
013	1CH	002	011	And Naason gendride Salmon; of which Salmon Booz was borun.
013	1CH	002	012	Sotheli Booz gendride Obeth; which hym silf gendride Ysay.
013	1CH	002	013	Forsothe Ysai gendride the firste gendride sone, Elyab, the secounde, Amynadab; the thridde, Samaa;
013	1CH	002	014	the fourthe, Nathanael;
013	1CH	002	015	the fyuethe, Sadai; the sixte, Asom;
013	1CH	002	016	the seuenthe, Dauyd; whose sistris weren Saruya, and Abigail. The sones of Saruye weren thre, Abisai, Joab, and Asahel.
013	1CH	002	017	Forsothe Abigail childide Amasa, whos fadir was Gether Hismaelite.
013	1CH	002	018	Sotheli Caleph, sone of Esrom, took a wijf, Azuba bi name, of whom he gendride Jerioth; and hise sones weren Jesar, and Sobab, and Ardon.
013	1CH	002	019	And whanne Azuba was deed, Caleph took a wijf Effrata, whiche childide Hur to hym.
013	1CH	002	020	Forsothe Hur gendride Hury; Hury gendride Beseleel.
013	1CH	002	021	After these thingis Esrom entride to the douytir of Machir, fadir of Galaad, and he took hir, whanne he was of sixti yeer; and sche childide Segub to hym.
013	1CH	002	022	But also Segub gendride Jair; and he hadde in possessioun thre and twenti citees in the lond of Galaad;
013	1CH	002	023	and he took Gessur, and Aran, the citees of Jair, and Chanath, and the townes therof of seuenti citees. Alle these weren the sones of Machir, fadir of Galaad.
013	1CH	002	024	Sotheli whanne Esrom was deed, Caleph entride in to Effrata. And Esrom hadde a wijf Abia, which childide to hym Assir, fadir of Thecue.
013	1CH	002	025	Forsothe sones weren borun of Jezrameel, the firste gendrid of Esrom; Ram, the first gendrid of hym, and Aran, and Ason, and Achia.
013	1CH	002	026	Also Jezrameel weddide anothir wijf, Athara bi name, that was the modir of Onam.
013	1CH	002	027	But and the sones of Ram, the firste gendrid of Jezrameel, weren Mohas, and Jamyn, and Achaz.
013	1CH	002	028	Forsothe Onam gendride sones, Semey, and Juda. Sotheli the sones of Semei weren Nadab, and Abisur;
013	1CH	002	029	forsothe the name of the wijf of Abisur was Abigail, that childide to hym Haaobban, and Molid.
013	1CH	002	030	Sotheli the sones of Nadab weren Saled and Apphaym; forsothe Saled diede without children.
013	1CH	002	031	Sotheli the sone of Apphaym was Jesi, which Jesi gendride Sesan; sotheli Sesan gendride Oholi.
013	1CH	002	032	Forsothe the sones of Jada, brother of Semei, weren Jether and Jonathan; but Jether diede with out sones; treuli Jonathan gendride Phalech,
013	1CH	002	033	and Ziza. These ben the sones of Jerameel.
013	1CH	002	034	Forsothe Sesan hadde not sones, but douytris, and a seruaunt of Egipt, Jeraa bi name;
013	1CH	002	035	and he yaf his douyter to wijf to Jeraa, whiche childide Ethei to hym.
013	1CH	002	036	Forsothe Ethei gendride Nathan, and Nathan gendride Zadab.
013	1CH	002	037	Also Zadab gendride Ophial, and Ophial gendride Obed.
013	1CH	002	038	Obed gendride Yeu, Yeu gendride Azarie,
013	1CH	002	039	Azarie gendride Helles, Helles gendride Elasa,
013	1CH	002	040	Elasa gendride Sesamoy, Sesamoy gendride Sellum,
013	1CH	002	041	Sellum gendride Jecamya, Jecamia gendride Elisama.
013	1CH	002	042	Forsothe the sones of Caleph, brothir of Jerameel, weren Mosa, the firste gendrid sone of hym; thilke is the fadir of Ziph; and the sones of Maresa, the fadir of Hebron.
013	1CH	002	043	Certis the sones of Ebron weren Chore, and Raphu, Recem, and Samma.
013	1CH	002	044	Forsothe Samma gendride Raam, the fadir of Jerechaam; and Recem gendride Semei.
013	1CH	002	045	The sone of Semei was Maon; and Maon was the fadir of Bethsur.
013	1CH	002	046	Sotheli Epha, the secundarie wijf of Caleph, childide Aram, and Musa, and Theser; forsothe Aram gendride Jezen.
013	1CH	002	047	The sones of Jadai weren Regon, and Jethon, and Zesum, Phalez, and Epha, and Saaph.
013	1CH	002	048	Matha, the secoundarie wijf of Caleph, childide Zaber, and Tharana.
013	1CH	002	049	Forsothe Saaph, the fadir of Madmenas, gendride Sue, the fadir of Magbena, and the fader of Gabaa; sotheli the douyter of Caleph was Axa.
013	1CH	002	050	These weren the sones of Caleph. The sones of Hur, the firste gendrid sone of Effrata, weren Sobal, the fader of Cariathiarim;
013	1CH	002	051	Salma, the fader of Bethleem; Ariph, the fader of Bethgader.
013	1CH	002	052	Sotheli the sones of Sobal, fader of Cariatiarim, that siy the myddil of restingis,
013	1CH	002	053	and was of the kynrede of Caryathiarym, weren Jethrey, and Aphutei, and Samathei, and Maserathei. Of these weren borun Sarytis, and Eschaolitis.
013	1CH	002	054	The sones of Salma, fadir of Bethleem, and of Netophati, weren the corouns of the hows of Joab, and the half of restyng of Sarai.
013	1CH	002	055	And the kynredis of scryuens, dwellynge in Jabes, syngynge, and sownynge, and dwellynge in tabernaclis. These ben Cyneis, that camen of the heete of the fadir of the hows of Rechab.
013	1CH	003	001	Forsothe Dauid hadde these sones, that weren borun to hym in Ebron; the firste gendrid sone, Amon, of Achynoem of Jezrael; the secounde sone, Danyel, of Abigail of Carmele;
013	1CH	003	002	the thridde, Absolon, the sone of Maacha, douyter of Tolomei, kyng of Gessuri; the fourthe, Adonye, sone of Agith;
013	1CH	003	003	the fyuethe, Saphacie, of Abithal; the sixte, Jethraan, of Egla his wijf.
013	1CH	003	004	Therfor sixe sones weren borun to hym in Ebron, where he regnede seuene yeer and sixe monethis; sotheli he regnyde thre and thritti yeer in Jerusalem.
013	1CH	003	005	Forsothe foure sones, Sama, and Sobab, and Nathan, and Salomon, weren borun of Bersabee, the douyter of Amyhel, to hym in Jerusalem;
013	1CH	003	006	also Jabaar, and Elisama, and Eliphalech,
013	1CH	003	007	and Noge, and Napheth, and Japhie,
013	1CH	003	008	also and Elisama, and Eliade, and Eliphalech, nyne.
013	1CH	003	009	Alle these weren the sones of David, with out the sones of secoundarie wyues; and thei hadden a sistir, Thamar.
013	1CH	003	010	Sotheli the sone of Salomon was Roboam, whos sone Abia gendride Asa;
013	1CH	003	011	and Josephat, the fadir of Joram, was borun of this Asa; which Joram gendride Ocozie, of whom Joas was borun.
013	1CH	003	012	And Amasie, the sone of this Joas, gendride Azarie; sotheli Azarie, the sone of Joathan,
013	1CH	003	013	gendride Achaz, the fadir of Ezechie; of whom Manasses was borun.
013	1CH	003	014	But also Manasses gendride Amon, the fadir of Josias.
013	1CH	003	015	Forsothe the sones of Josias weren, the firste gendrid sone, Johannan; the secounde, Joachym; the thridde, Sedechie; the fourthe, Sellum.
013	1CH	003	016	Of Joachym was borun Jechonye, and Sedechie.
013	1CH	003	017	The sones of Jechonye weren Asir,
013	1CH	003	018	Salatiel, Melchiram, Phadaie, Sennaser, and Jech, Semma, Sama, and Nadabia.
013	1CH	003	019	Of Phadaie weren borun Zorobabel, and Semey. Zorobabel gendryde Mosolla, Ananye, and Salomyth, the sister of hem; and Asaba,
013	1CH	003	020	and Ochol, and Barachie, and Asadaie, and Josabesed, fyue.
013	1CH	003	021	Forsothe the sone of Ananye was Falcias, the fadir of Jeseie, whose sone was Raphaie. And the sone of him was Arnan, of whom was borun Abdia, whos sone was Sechema.
013	1CH	003	022	The sone of Sechema was Semeia, whose sones weren Archus, and Gegal, and Baaria, and Naaria, and Saphat, and Sela; sixe in noumbre.
013	1CH	003	023	The sones of Naaria weren thre, Helionai, and Ezechie, and Zichram.
013	1CH	003	024	The sones of Helionai weren seuene, Odyna, and Eliasub, and Pheleia, and Accub, and Johannan, and Dalaia, and Anani.
013	1CH	004	001	The sones of Juda weren Phares, and Esrom, and Carmy, and Hur, and Sobal.
013	1CH	004	002	Forsothe Reaia, the sone of Sobal, gendride Geth; of whom weren borun Achymai, and Laed. These weren the kynredis of Sarathi.
013	1CH	004	003	And this is the generacioun of Ethan; Jesrael, Jezema, and Jedebos; and the name of the sistir of hem was Asaelphumy.
013	1CH	004	004	Sotheli Phunyel was the fadir of Gedor, and Ezer was the fadir of Osa; these ben the sones of Hur, the firste gendrid sone of Effrata, the fadir of Bethleem.
013	1CH	004	005	Sotheli Assur, the fadir of Thecue, hadde twei wyues, Haala, and Naara;
013	1CH	004	006	forsothe Naara childide to hym Oozam, and Epher, and Theman, and Aschari; these ben the sones of Naara.
013	1CH	004	007	Forsothe the sones of Haala weren Sereth, Isaar, and Ethan.
013	1CH	004	008	Forsothe Chus gendride Anob, and Sobala, and the kynredis of Arab, sone of Arym.
013	1CH	004	009	Forsothe Jabes was noble byfor alle hise britheren; and his modir clepide his name Jabes, and seide, For Y childide hym in sorewe.
013	1CH	004	010	Sotheli Jabes clepide inwardli God of Israel, and seide, Yf thou blessynge schal blesse me, and schalt alarge my termes, and if thin hond schal be with me, and thou schalt make me to be not oppressid of malice. And God yaf to hym that thing, that he preiede.
013	1CH	004	011	Forsothe Caleph, the brother of Sua, gendride Machir, that was the fadir of Eston;
013	1CH	004	012	sotheli Eston gendride Beth, Rapha, and Phese, and Thena, the fadir of the citee Naas. These ben the sones of Recha.
013	1CH	004	013	Forsothe the sones of Cenez weren Othonyel, and Saraia.
013	1CH	004	014	Sotheli the sones of Othonyel weren Athiath, and Maonaththa, that gendride Opham. Forsothe Saraia gendride Joab, the fadir of the valey of crafti men; for there weren crafti men.
013	1CH	004	015	Sotheli the sones of Caleph, sone of Jephone, weren Hyn, and Helam, and Nahemi. And the sones of Helam weren Cenez.
013	1CH	004	016	Also the sones of Jaleel weren Zeph, and Zipha, Tiria, and Asrael.
013	1CH	004	017	And the sones of Esra weren Chether, and Merid, and Epher, and Jalon; and he gendride Marie, and Semmai, and Jesba, the fadir of Eschamo.
013	1CH	004	018	Also Judaia, hys wijf, childide Jared, the fadir of Gedor; and Heber, the fadir of Zocho; and Hieutihel, the fadir of Janon. Sotheli these weren the sones of Bethie, the douyter of Pharao, whom Mered took to wijf.
013	1CH	004	019	And the sones of the wijf of Odoie, sister of Nathan, fadir of Ceila, weren Garmy, and Escamo, that was of Machati.
013	1CH	004	020	Also the sones of Symeon weren Amon and Rena; the sone of Anam was Chilon; and the sones of Gesi weren Zoeth, and Benzoeth.
013	1CH	004	021	The sones of Cela, sone of Juda, weren Her, the fadir of Lecha, and Laada, the fadir of Marasa; and these weren the kynredis of the hows of men worchynge biys in the hows of an ooth,
013	1CH	004	022	and which made the sunne to stonde, and the men of leesyng, sikir, and goynge, that weren princes in Moab, and that turneden ayen in to Bethleem; forsothe these ben elde wordis.
013	1CH	004	023	These ben potteris dwellinge in plauntyngis, and in heggis, anentis kyngis in her werkis; and thei dwelliden there.
013	1CH	004	024	The sones of Symeon weren Namyhel, and Jamyn, Jarib, Zara, Saul.
013	1CH	004	025	Sellum was his sone; Mapsan was his sone; Masma was his sone.
013	1CH	004	026	The sones of Masma; Amuel, his sone; and Zaccur, his sone; Semey, his sone.
013	1CH	004	027	The sones of Semey weren sixtene, and sixe douytris; sotheli hise britheren hadden not many sones, and al the kynrede myyte not be euene to the summe of the sones of Juda.
013	1CH	004	028	Forsothe thei dwelliden in Bersabee, and in Molada, and in Asarsual,
013	1CH	004	029	and in Balaa, and in Aason, and in Tholat,
013	1CH	004	030	and in Bathuel, and in Horma,
