013	1CH	007	020	Sotheli the sones of Effraym weren Suchaba; Bareth, his sone; Caath, his sone; Elda, his sone; and Thaath, his sone; and Zadaba, his sone;
013	1CH	007	021	and Suthala, his sone; and Ezer, and Elad, his sones. Forsothe men of Geth borun in the lond killiden hem, for thei yeden doun to assaile her possessiouns.
013	1CH	007	022	Therfor Effraym, the fadir of hem, weilide bi many daies; and hise britheren camen to coumforte hym.
013	1CH	007	023	And he entride to his wijf, which conseyuede, and childide a sone; and he clepide his name Beria, for he was borun in the yuelis of his hows.
