013	1CH	010	004	And Saul seide to his squiere, Drawe out thi swerd, and sle me, leste these vncircumcidid men come, and scorne me. Sothli his squyer was aferd bi drede, and nolde do this; therfor Saul took a swerd, and felde on it.
013	1CH	010	005	And whanne his squyer hadde seyn this, that is, that Saul was deed, he felde also on his swerd, and was deed.
