019	PSA	011	007	For the Lord is riytful, and louede riytfulnessis; his cheer siy equite, `ethir euennesse.
019	PSA	012	001	To the victorie on the eiyte, the song of Dauid. Lord, make thou me saaf, for the hooli failide; for treuthis ben maad litle fro the sones of men.
