019	PSA	072	001	`To Salomon.
019	PSA	072	002	God, yyue thi doom to the king; and thi riytfulnesse to the sone of a king. To deme thi puple in riytfulnesse; and thi pore men in doom.
019	PSA	072	003	Mounteyns resseyue pees to the puple; and litle hillis resseyue riytfulnesse.
019	PSA	072	004	He schal deme the pore men of the puple, and he schal make saaf the sones of pore men; and he schal make low the false chalengere.
019	PSA	072	005	And he schal dwelle with the sunne, and bifore the moone; in generacioun and in to generacioun.
019	PSA	072	006	He schal come doun as reyn in to a flees; and as goteris droppinge on the erthe.
019	PSA	072	007	Riytfulnesse schal come forth in hise dayes, and the aboundaunce of pees; til the moone be takun awei.
