019	PSA	078	054	And he brouyte hem in to the hil of his halewyng; in to the hil which his riythond gat. And he castide out hethene men fro the face of hem; and bi lot he departide to hem the lond in a cord of delyng.
019	PSA	078	055	And he made the lynagis of Israel to dwelle in the tabernaclis of hem.
