019	PSA	079	001	Of Asaph. God, hethene men cam in to thin eritage; thei defouliden thin hooli temple, thei settiden Jerusalem in to the keping of applis.
019	PSA	079	002	Thei settiden the slayn bodies of thi seruauntis, meetis to the volatilis of heuenes; the fleischis of thi seyntis to the beestis of the erthe.
019	PSA	079	003	Thei schedden out the blood of hem, as watir in the cumpas of Jerusalem; and noon was that biriede.
