019	PSA	079	005	Lord, hou longe schalt thou be wrooth in to the ende? schal thi veniaunce be kyndelid as fier?
019	PSA	079	006	Schede out thin ire in to hethene men, that knowen not thee; and in to rewmes, that clepiden not thi name.
019	PSA	079	007	For thei eeten Jacob; and maden desolat his place.
