019	PSA	079	013	But we that ben thi puple, and the scheep of thi leesewe; schulen knouleche to thee in to the world. In generacioun and in to generacioun; we schulen telle thin heriyng.
019	PSA	080	001	To victorie; this salm is witnessing of Asaph for lilies. Thou that gouernest Israel, yyue tent; that leedist forth Joseph as a scheep. Thou that sittist on cherubym; be schewid bifore Effraym,
019	PSA	080	002	Beniamyn, and Manasses. Stire thi power, and come thou; that thou make vs saaf.
019	PSA	080	003	God of vertues, turne thou vs; and schewe thi face, and we schulen be saaf.
019	PSA	080	004	Lord God of vertues; hou longe schalt thou be wrooth on the preier of thi seruaunt?
019	PSA	080	005	Hou longe schalt thou feede vs with the breed of teeris; and schalt yyue drynke to vs with teeris in mesure?
019	PSA	080	006	Thou hast set vs in to ayenseiyng to oure neiyboris; and oure enemyes han scornyde vs.
019	PSA	080	007	God of vertues, turne thou vs; and schewe thi face, and we schulen be saaf.
