019	PSA	082	001	Of Asaph. God stood in the synagoge of goddis; forsothe he demeth goddis in the myddil.
019	PSA	082	002	Hou longe demen ye wickidnesse; and taken the faces of synneris?
019	PSA	082	003	Deme ye to the nedi man, and to the modirles child; iustifie ye the meke man and pore.
019	PSA	082	004	Raueische ye out a pore man; and delyuere ye the nedi man fro the hond of the synner.
019	PSA	082	005	Thei knewen not, nether vndirstoden, thei goen in derknessis; alle the foundementis of erthe schulen be moued.
