019	PSA	084	003	For whi a sparewe fyndith an hous to it silf; and a turtle fyndith a neste to it silf, where it `schal kepe hise bryddis. Lord of vertues, thin auteris; my king, and my God.
019	PSA	084	004	Lord, blessid ben thei that dwellen in thin hous; thei schulen preise thee in to the worldis of worldis.
