019	PSA	085	001	Of the sones of Chore. Lord, thou hast blessid thi lond; thou hast turned awei the caitifte of Jacob.
019	PSA	085	002	Thou hast foryoue the wickidnesse of thi puple; thou hast hilid alle the synnes of hem.
019	PSA	085	003	Thou hast aswagid al thin ire; thou hast turned awei fro the ire of thin indignacioun.
019	PSA	085	004	God, oure helthe, conuerte thou vs; and turne awei thin ire fro vs.
