019	PSA	086	001	The preier of Dauid. Lord, bowe doun thin eere, and here me; for Y am nedi and pore.
019	PSA	086	002	Kepe thou my lijf, for Y am holi; my God, make thou saaf thi seruaunt hopynge in thee.
019	PSA	086	003	Lord, haue thou merci on me, for Y criede al day to thee;
