019	PSA	088	001	The song of salm, to the sones of Chore, to victorie on Mahalat, for to answere, the lernyng of Heman Ezraite. Lord God of myn helthe; Y criede in dai and nyyt bifore thee.
019	PSA	088	002	Mi preier entre bifore thi siyt; bowe doun thin eere to my preier.
019	PSA	088	003	For my soule is fillid with yuels; and my lijf neiyede to helle.
