019	PSA	088	005	and fre among deed men. As men woundid slepinge in sepulcris, of whiche men noon is myndeful aftir; and thei ben put awei fro thin hond.
019	PSA	088	006	Thei han put me in the lower lake; in derke places, and in the schadewe of deth.
019	PSA	088	007	Thi strong veniaunce is confermed on me; and thou hast brouyt in alle thi wawis on me.
