019	PSA	089	003	I disposide a testament to my chosun men; Y swoor to Dauid, my seruaunt,
019	PSA	089	004	Til in to with outen ende I schal make redi thi seed. And Y schal bilde thi seete; in generacioun, and in to generacioun.
019	PSA	089	005	Lord, heuenes schulen knouleche thi merueilis; and thi treuthe in the chirche of seyntis.
