019	PSA	089	007	God, which is glorified in the counsel of seyntis; is greet, and dreedful ouere alle that ben in his cumpas.
019	PSA	089	008	Lord God of vertues, who is lijk thee? Lord, thou art miyti, and thi treuthe is in thi cumpas.
019	PSA	089	009	Thou art Lord of the power of the see; forsothe thou aswagist the stiryng of the wawis therof.
019	PSA	089	010	Thou madist lowe the proude, as woundid; in the arm of thi vertu thou hast scaterid thin enemyes.
019	PSA	089	011	Heuenes ben thin, and erthe is thin; thou hast foundid the world, and the fulnesse therof;
019	PSA	089	012	thou madist of nouyt the north and the see. Thabor and Hermon schulen make ful out ioye in thi name;
019	PSA	089	013	thin arm with power. Thin hond be maad stidefast, and thi riythond be enhaunsid;
019	PSA	089	014	riytfulnesse and doom is the makyng redy of thi seete. Merci and treuthe schulen go bifore thi face;
019	PSA	089	015	blessid is the puple that kan hertli song. Lord, thei schulen go in the liyt of thi cheer;
019	PSA	089	016	and in thi name thei schulen make ful out ioye al dai; and thei schulen be enhaunsid in thi riytfulnesse.
019	PSA	089	017	For thou art the glorie of the vertu of hem; and in thi good plesaunce oure horn schal be enhaunsid.
019	PSA	089	018	For oure takyng vp is of the Lord; and of the hooli of Israel oure kyng.
