019	PSA	089	027	And Y schal sette him the firste gendrid sone; hiyer than the kyngis of erthe.
019	PSA	089	028	With outen ende Y schal kepe my merci to hym; and my testament feithful to him.
019	PSA	089	029	And Y schal sette his seed in to the world of world; and his trone as the daies of heuene.
019	PSA	089	030	Forsothe if hise sones forsaken my lawe; and goen not in my domes.
019	PSA	089	031	If thei maken vnhooli my riytfulnessis; and kepen not my comaundementis.
