019	PSA	089	033	But Y schal not scatere my mercy fro hym; and in my treuthe Y schal not anoye hym.
019	PSA	089	034	Nethir Y schal make vnhooli my testament; and Y schal not make voide tho thingis that comen forth of my lippis.
019	PSA	089	035	Onys Y swoor in myn hooli;
019	PSA	089	036	Y schal not lie to Dauid, his seed schal dwelle with outen ende.
019	PSA	089	037	And his trone as sunne in my siyt, and as a perfit mone with outen ende; and a feithful witnesse in heuene.
019	PSA	089	038	But thou hast put awei, and hast dispisid; and hast dilaied thi crist.
019	PSA	089	039	Thou hast turned awei the testament of thi seruaunt; thou madist vnhooli his seyntuarie in erthe.
019	PSA	089	040	Thou distriedist alle the heggis therof; thou hast set the stidefastnesse therof drede.
