019	PSA	090	001	The preier of Moises, the man of God. Lord, thou art maad help to vs; fro generacioun in to generacioun.
019	PSA	090	002	Bifore that hillis weren maad, ether the erthe and the world was formed; fro the world and in to the world thou art God.
019	PSA	090	003	Turne thou not awei a man in to lownesse; and thou seidist, Ye sones of men, be conuertid.
