019	PSA	090	005	The yeeris of hem schulen be; that ben had for nouyt.
019	PSA	090	006	Eerli passe he, as an eerbe, eerli florische he, and passe; in the euentid falle he doun, be he hard, and wexe drie.
019	PSA	090	007	For we han failid in thin ire; and we ben disturblid in thi strong veniaunce.
019	PSA	090	008	Thou hast set oure wickidnessis in thi siyt; oure world in the liytning of thi cheer.
019	PSA	090	009	For alle oure daies han failid; and we han failid in thin ire. Oure yeris schulen bithenke, as an yreyn;
019	PSA	090	010	the daies of oure yeeris ben in tho seuenti yeeris. Forsothe, if fourescoor yeer ben in myyti men; and the more tyme of hem is trauel and sorewe. For myldenesse cam aboue; and we schulen be chastisid.
019	PSA	090	011	Who knew the power of thin ire; and durste noumbre thin ire for thi drede?
