019	PSA	091	008	Netheles thou schalt biholde with thin iyen; and thou schalt se the yelding of synneris.
019	PSA	091	009	For thou, Lord, art myn hope; thou hast set thin help altherhiyeste.
019	PSA	091	010	Yuel schal not come to thee; and a scourge schal not neiye to thi tabernacle.
019	PSA	091	011	For God hath comaundid to hise aungels of thee; that thei kepe thee in alle thi weies.
019	PSA	091	012	Thei schulen beere thee in the hondis; leste perauenture thou hirte thi foot at a stoon.
019	PSA	091	013	Thou schalt go on a snake, and a cocatrice; and thou schalt defoule a lioun and a dragoun.
