019	PSA	092	001	`The salm of `song, in the dai of sabath. It is good to knouleche to the Lord; and to synge to thi name, thou hiyeste.
019	PSA	092	002	To schewe eerli thi merci; and thi treuthe bi nyyt.
019	PSA	092	003	In a sautrie of ten cordis; with song in harpe.
