019	PSA	119	128	Therfor Y was dressid to alle thin heestis; Y hatide al wickid weie.
019	PSA	119	129	Lord, thi witnessingis ben wondirful; therfor my soule souyte tho.
019	PSA	119	130	Declaring of thi wordis liytneth; and yyueth vnderstonding to meke men.
019	PSA	119	131	I openede my mouth, and drouy the spirit; for Y desiride thi comaundementis.
019	PSA	119	132	Biholde thou on me, and haue merci on me; bi the dom of hem that louen thi name.
