019	PSA	130	001	The song of greces. Lord, Y criede to thee fro depthes; Lord, here thou mi vois.
019	PSA	130	002	Thin eeris be maad ententif; in to the vois of my biseching.
019	PSA	130	003	Lord, if thou kepist wickidnessis; Lord, who schal susteyne?
019	PSA	130	004	For merci is at thee; and, Lord, for thi lawe Y abood thee. Mi soule susteynede in his word; my soule hopide in the Lord.
019	PSA	130	005	Fro the morewtid keping til to niyt;
019	PSA	130	006	Israel hope in the Lord.
019	PSA	130	007	For whi merci is at the Lord; and plenteous redempcioun is at hym.
