019	PSA	131	001	The song of greces, `to Dauith himself. Lord, myn herte is not enhaunsid; nether myn iyen ben reisid. Nether Y yede in the grete thingis; nether in merueilis aboue me.
019	PSA	131	002	If Y feelide not mekely; but enhaunside my soule. As a childe wenyde on his modir; so yelding be in my soule.
019	PSA	131	003	Israel hope in the Lord; fro this tyme now and in to the world.
019	PSA	132	001	The song of greces. Lord, haue thou mynde on Dauid; and of al his myldenesse.
019	PSA	132	002	As he swoor to the Lord; he made a vowe to God of Jacob.
019	PSA	132	003	I schal not entre in to the tabernacle of myn hous; Y schal not stie in to the bed of mi restyng.
