019	PSA	132	005	And rest to my templis, til Y fynde a place to the Lord; a tabernacle to God of Jacob.
019	PSA	132	006	Lo! we herden that arke of testament in Effrata, `that is, in Silo; we founden it in the feeldis of the wode.
019	PSA	132	007	We schulen entre in to the tabernacle of hym; we schulen worschipe in the place, where hise feet stoden.
019	PSA	132	008	Lord, rise thou in to thi reste; thou and the ark of thin halewing.
019	PSA	132	009	Thi prestis be clothid with riytfulnesse; and thi seyntis make ful out ioye.
019	PSA	132	010	For Dauid, thi seruaunt; turne thou not awei the face of thi crist.
019	PSA	132	011	The Lord swoor treuthe to Dauid, and he schal not make hym veyn; of the fruyt of thi wombe Y schal sette on thi seete.
