019	PSA	132	018	I schal clothe hise enemyes with schame; but myn halewing schal floure out on hym.
019	PSA	133	001	The song of grecis. Lo! hou good and hou myrie it is; that britheren dwelle togidere.
019	PSA	133	002	As oynement in the heed; that goith doun in to the beerd, in to the beerd of Aaron. That goith doun in to the coler of his cloth; as the dew of Ermon,
019	PSA	133	003	that goith doun in to the hil of Sion. For there the Lord sente blessing; and lijf til in to the world.
