019	PSA	135	001	Alleluya. Herie ye the name of the Lord; ye seruauntis of the Lord, herie ye.
019	PSA	135	002	Ye that stonden in the hous of the Lord; in the hallis of `the hous of oure God.
019	PSA	135	003	Herie ye the Lord, for the Lord is good; singe ye to his name, for it is swete.
019	PSA	135	004	For the Lord chees Jacob to him silf; Israel in to possessioun to him silf.
019	PSA	135	005	For Y haue knowe, that the Lord is greet; and oure God bifore alle goddis.
