024	JER	001	007	And the Lord seide to me, Nyle thou seie, that Y am a child; for thou schalt go to alle thingis, to whiche Y schal sende thee, and thou schalt speke alle thingis, what euer thingis Y schal comaunde to thee.
024	JER	001	008	Drede thou not of the face of hem, for Y am with thee, to delyuere thee, seith the Lord.
