027	DAN	004	003	therfor it pleside me to preche hise myraclis, for tho ben greet, and hise merueils, for tho ben stronge; and his rewme is an euerlastynge rewme, and his power is in generacioun and in to generacioun.
027	DAN	004	004	I, Nabugodonosor, was restful in myn hous, and flourynge in my paleis;
027	DAN	004	005	Y siy a dreem, that made me aferd; and my thouytis in my bed, and the siytis of myn heed disturbliden me.
