028	HOS	001	001	The word of the Lord that was maad to Osee, the sone of Bery, in the daies of Osie, Joathan, Achas, Ezechie, kingis of Juda, and in the daies of Jeroboam, sone of Joas, the kyng of Israel.
028	HOS	001	002	The bigynnyng of the spekyng to the Lord in Osee. And the Lord seide to Osee, Go thou, take to thee a wijf of fornycaciouns, and make to thee sones of fornycaciouns, for the lond doynge fornicacioun schal do fornicacioun fro the Lord.
028	HOS	001	003	And he yede, and took Gomer, the douyter of Debelaym; and sche conseyuede, and childide a sone to hym.
028	HOS	001	004	And the Lord seide to hym, Clepe thou the name of hym Jesrael; for yit a litil and Y schal visite the blood of Jesrael on the hous of Hieu, and Y schal make to reste the rewme of the hous of Israel.
028	HOS	001	005	And in that dai Y schal al to-breke the bowe of Israel in the valei of Jesrael.
