030	AMO	002	015	and he that holdith a bowe schal not stonde, and a swift man schal not be sauyd by hise feet; and the stiere of an hors schal not saue his lijf,
030	AMO	002	016	and a stronge man of herte schal fle nakid among stronge men in that dai, seith the Lord.
030	AMO	003	001	Sones of Israel, here ye the word which the Lord spak on you, and on al the kynrede, which Y ledde out of the lond of Egipt,
030	AMO	003	002	and seide, Oneli Y knewe you of alle the kynredis of erthe; therfor Y schal visite on you alle youre wickidnessis.
030	AMO	003	003	Whether tweyne schulen go togidere, no but it acorde to hem?
