042	LUK	001	029	And whanne sche hadde herd, sche was troublid in his word, and thouyte what maner salutacioun this was.
042	LUK	001	030	And the aungel seide to hir, Ne drede thou not, Marie, for thou hast foundun grace anentis God.
042	LUK	001	031	Lo! thou schalt conceyue in wombe, and schalt bere a sone, and thou schalt clepe his name Jhesus.
