043	JOH	005	032	another is that berith witnessyng of me, and Y woot that his witnessyng is trewe, that he berith of me.
043	JOH	005	033	Ye senten to Joon, and he bar witnessyng to treuthe.
043	JOH	005	034	But Y take not witnessyng of man; but Y seie these thingis, that ye be saaf.
