043	JOH	005	044	Hou moun ye bileue, that resseyuen glorie ech of othere, and ye seken not the glorie `that is of God aloone?
043	JOH	005	045	Nyle ye gesse, that Y am to accuse you anentis the fadir; it is Moises that accusith you, in whom ye hopen.
043	JOH	005	046	For if ye bileueden to Moises, perauenture ye schulden bileue also to me; for he wroot of me.
