043	JOH	006	001	Aftir these thingis Jhesus wente ouere the see of Galilee, that is Tiberias.
043	JOH	006	002	And a greet multitude suede hym; for thei sayn the tokenes, that he dide on hem that weren sijke.
043	JOH	006	003	Therfor Jhesus wente in to an hil, and sat there with hise disciplis.
043	JOH	006	004	And the paske was ful niy, a feeste dai of the Jewis.
