043	JOH	006	019	Therfor whanne thei hadden rowid as fyue and twenti furlongis or thretti, thei seen Jhesus walkynge on the see, and to be neiy the boot; and thei dredden.
043	JOH	006	020	And he seide to hem, Y am; nyle ye drede.
