043	JOH	006	032	Therfor Jhesus seith to hem, Treuli, treuli, Y seie to you, Moyses yaf you not breed fro heuene, but my fadir yyueth you veri breed fro heuene;
043	JOH	006	033	for it is very breed that cometh doun fro heuene, and yyueth lijf to the world.
043	JOH	006	034	Therfor thei seiden to hym, Lord, euere yyue vs this breed.
043	JOH	006	035	And Jhesus seide to hem, Y am breed of lijf; he that cometh to me, schal not hungur; he that bileueth in me, schal neuere thirste.
