043	JOH	007	011	Therfor the Jewis souyten hym in the feeste dai, and seiden, Where is he?
043	JOH	007	012	And myche grutchyng was of hym among the puple. For summe seiden, That he is good; and othere seiden, Nai, but he disceyueth the puple;
043	JOH	007	013	netheles no man spak opynli of hym, for drede of the Jewis.
043	JOH	007	014	But whanne the myddil feeste dai cam, Jhesus wente vp in to the temple, and tauyte.
