043	JOH	007	023	If a man take circumcicioun in the sabat, that the lawe of Moises be not brokun, han ye indignacioun to me, for Y made al a man hool in the sabat?
043	JOH	007	024	Nile ye deme aftir the face, but deme ye a riytful doom.
