043	JOH	008	051	Treuli, treuli, Y seie to you, if ony man kepe my word, he schal not taste deth with outen ende.
043	JOH	008	052	Therfor the Jewis seiden, Now we han knowun, that thou hast a deuel. Abraham is deed, and the prophetis, and thou seist, If ony man kepe my word, he schal not taste deth withouten ende.
