046	1CO	007	030	and thei that wepen, as thei wepten not; and thei that ioien, as thei ioieden not; and thei that bien, as thei hadden not;
046	1CO	007	031	and thei that vsen this world, as thei that vsen not. For whi the figure of this world passith.
