047	2CO	003	009	For if the mynystracioun of dampnacioun was in glorie, myche more the mynysterie of riytwisnesse is plenteuouse in glorie.
047	2CO	003	010	For nether that that was cleer was glorified in this part for the excellent glorie; and if that that is auoidid,
047	2CO	003	011	was bi glorie, myche more that that dwellith stille is in glorie.
