058	HEB	003	018	And to whiche swoor he, that thei schulden not entre in to the reste of hym, not but to hem that weren vnbileueful?
058	HEB	003	019	And we seen, that thei myyten not entre in to the reste of hym for vnbileue.
058	HEB	004	001	Therfor drede we, lest perauenture while the biheest of entryng in to his reste is left, that ony of vs be gessid to be awei.
058	HEB	004	002	For it is told also to vs, as to hem. And the word that was herd profitide not to hem, not meynd to feith of tho thingis that thei herden.
058	HEB	004	003	For we that han bileued, schulen entre in to reste, as he seide, As Y swoor in my wraththe, thei schulen not entre in to my reste. And whanne the werkis weren maad perfit at the ordynaunce of the world,
058	HEB	004	004	he seide thus in a place of the seuenthe dai, And God restide in the seuenthe dai from alle hise werkis.
058	HEB	004	005	And in this place eftsoone, Thei schulen not entre in to my reste.
058	HEB	004	006	Therfor for it sueth, that summen schulen entre in to it, and thei to whiche it was teld to bifor, entriden not for her vnbileue.
058	HEB	004	007	Eftsoone he termyneth sum dai, and seith in Dauith, To dai, aftir so myche tyme of tyme, as it is biforseid, To dai if ye han herd his vois, nyle ye hardne youre hertis.
058	HEB	004	008	For if Jhesus hadde youun reste to hem, he schulde neuere speke of othere aftir this dai.
058	HEB	004	009	Therfor the sabat is left to the puple of God.
058	HEB	004	010	For he that is entrid in to his reste, restide of hise werkis, as also God of hise.
058	HEB	004	011	Therfor haste we to entre in to that reste, that no man falle in to the same ensaumple of vnbileue. For the word of God is quyk,
