058	HEB	004	015	For we han not a bischop, that may not haue compassioun on oure infirmytees, but was temptid bi alle thingis bi lycnesse, with oute synne.
058	HEB	004	016	Therfor go we with trist to the trone of his grace, that we gete merci, and fynde grace in couenable help.
