058	HEB	005	002	Which may togidere sorewe with hem, that beth vnkunnynge and erren; for also he is enuyrounned with infirmytee.
058	HEB	005	003	And therfor he owith, as for the puple, so also for hym silf, to offre for synnes.
058	HEB	005	004	Nethir ony man taketh to hym onour, but he that is clepid of God, as Aaron was.
