058	HEB	005	006	As `in anothere place he seith, Thou art a prest with outen ende, aftir the ordre of Melchisedech.
058	HEB	005	007	Which in the daies of his fleisch offride, with greet cry and teeris, preieris and bisechingis to hym that myyte make hym saaf fro deth, and was herd for his reuerence.
