058	HEB	005	012	For whanne ye ouyten to be maistris for tyme, eftsoone ye neden that ye be tauyt, whiche ben the lettris of the bigynnyng of Goddis wordis. And ye ben maad thilke, to whiche is nede of mylk, and not sad mete.
058	HEB	005	013	For ech that is parcenere of mylk, is with out part of the word of riytwisnesse, for he is a litil child.
