060	1PE	003	002	And biholde ye in drede youre hooli conuersacioun.
060	1PE	003	003	Of whiche `ther be not with outforth curious ournyng of heer, ether doyng aboute of gold, ethir ournyng of clothing;
060	1PE	003	004	but thilke that is the hid man of herte, in vncorrupcioun, and of mylde spirit, which is riche in the siyt of God.
