060	1PE	003	009	not yeldinge yuel for yuel, nether cursing for cursing, but ayenward blessinge; for in this thing ye ben clepid, that ye welde blessinge bi eritage.
060	1PE	003	010	For he that wole loue lijf, and se goode daies, constreyne his tunge from yuel, and hise lippis, that thei speke not gile.
060	1PE	003	011	And bowe he from yuel, and do good; seke he pees, and perfitli sue it.
