# BOOK	061	2PE	2 Peter	2 Peter
061	2PE	001	001	Simount Petre, seruaunt and apostle of `Jhesu Crist, to hem that han take with vs the euene feith, in the riytwisnesse of oure God and sauyour Jhesu Crist,
061	2PE	001	002	grace and pees be fillid to you, bi the knowing of oure Lord Jhesu Crist.
061	2PE	001	003	Hou alle thingis of his godlich vertu, that ben to lijf and pitee, ben youun to vs, bi the knowyng of hym, that clepide vs for his owne glorie and vertu.
061	2PE	001	004	Bi whom he yaf to vs moost preciouse biheestis; that bi these thingis ye schulen be maad felows of Goddis kynde, and fle the corrupcioun of that coueytise, that is in the world.
061	2PE	001	005	And bringe ye in alle bisynesse, and mynystre ye in youre feith vertu, and `in vertu kunnyng;
061	2PE	001	006	in kunnyng abstinence, in abstynence pacience, in pacience pitee;
061	2PE	001	007	in pitee, love of britherhod, and in loue of britherhod charite.
061	2PE	001	008	For if these ben with you, and ouercomen, thei schulen not make you voide, nethir with out fruyt, in the knowyng of oure Lord Jhesu Crist.
061	2PE	001	009	But to whom these ben not redi, he is blynd, and gropith with his hoond, and foryetith the purgyng of his elde trespassis.
061	2PE	001	010	Wherfor, britheren, be ye more bisi, that by goode werkis ye make youre clepyng and chesyng certeyn; for ye doynge these thingis schulen not do synne ony tyme.
