061	2PE	002	006	and he droof in to poudre the citees of men of Sodom and of men of Gommor, and dampnede bi turnyng vpsedoun, and putte hem the ensaumple of hem that weren to doynge yuele;
061	2PE	002	007	and delyuerid the iust Loth, oppressid of the wrong, and of the letcherouse conuersacioun of cursid men;
061	2PE	002	008	for in siyt and hering he was iust, and dwellide amongst hem that fro dai in to dai turmentiden with wickid werkis a iust soule.
