# BOOK	065	JUD	Jude	Jude
065	JUD	001	001	Judas, the seruaunt of Jhesu Crist, and brother of James, to these that ben louyd, that ben in God the fadir, and to hem that ben clepid and kept of Jhesu Crist,
065	JUD	001	002	mercy, and pees, and charite be fillid to you.
